From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:45:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 48/58] ple: the pull registry refuses unbound or clashing
 names; test fixes

A schema walk fails on any pointer-like int parameter of a custom op on the
PLE path. The FULL_K test child calls the Marlin MoE GEMM by keyword against
its v0.30.0 signature.
---
